An open-source Model Context Protocol server for the Pinterest Ads API.
It is self-hosted and unaffiliated with Pinterest.

GetMCPAds also runs a managed gateway that covers Pinterest Ads alongside
Meta Ads, Google Ads, TikTok Ads, Google Analytics and Search Console, with
hosted OAuth and cross-platform reporting: https://www.getmcpads.com

